r Battery BMS: Reacting to Acute Threats**: NEV BMS prioritizes instant crisis response. * **Power Battery BMS** is exploring \"wireless management\" to reduce wiring weight and boost NEV range. In essence, ESS BMS and power battery BMS exemplify how engineering solutions adapt to unique environmental and user needs, proving that \"different tracks\" can drive shared progress in the clean energy revolution.",
